<title>KAZAKHSTAN: KAZAKHSTAN AUCTIONS 600 MLN TENGE BILLS AUGUST 18.</title>
<headline>KAZAKHSTAN AUCTIONS 600 MLN TENGE BILLS AUGUST 18.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 600 million tenge of six-month MKM discount Treasury bills on August 18, the National Bank said on August 13.</p>
<p>Full details of the six-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ46K1902985</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   600 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    182 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     Aug 18</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Feb 19, 1998</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509 410</p>
